@nanobpm/agentic 0.14.0

Provenance
==========

The JSON files in this directory are a byte-exact snapshot of the shared
agentic-protocol conformance corpus published by `@nanobpm/agentic`, taken from
the package's `protocol/conformance` export at the version above:

  npm pack @nanobpm/agentic@0.14.0
  # dump GOLDEN_FRAMES, MALFORMED_FRAMES, VALID_CONTROL_FRAMES,
  # MALFORMED_CONTROL_FRAMES, ACP_TRANSCRIPT_VECTORS, VALID/INVALID_VOCABS,
  # VALID/INVALID_TOKENS from dist/protocol/conformance/index.js

The corpus is deliberately cross-repo: the same golden vectors hold BOTH the
Node worker (jwulf/c8ctl-plugin-nano) and this repo's worker-side hub codec to
identical wire bytes, so the two can never drift. `tests/hub.rs` replays this
snapshot and diffs the frames.

Files
=====

  golden-frames.json            frame <-> exact wire bytes (hex), both directions
  malformed-frames.json         adversarial byte sequences + expected decode error
  control-frames.json           inbound steer chunks + typed frame (+ round-trip flag)
  malformed-control-frames.json tagged-but-malformed steer chunks + expected error
  transcript-vectors.json       ACP session/update -> exact chunk bytes -> typed event
  valid-vocabs.json             valid vocab documents (registry schema)
  invalid-vocabs.json           invalid vocab documents + expected error code
  valid-tokens.json             routing tokens + their parse
  invalid-tokens.json           malformed routing tokens + expected error code

To refresh against a newer corpus, re-run the dump above, bump the version at
the top of this file, and re-run `cargo test -p contract-tests --test hub`.
